      "created_at": "2020-06-23T23:34:49.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>This actually brings up an interesting question. If you're in Oblivaeon, and Fanatic has, say, the T-Rex bot in play, and Fanatic doesn't do any damage but the T-Rex bot chomps someone for 9 damage, did&nbsp;<em>I&nbsp;</em>do three damage for keeping Zealous Offense around? Should it be keyed to Fanatic, or to cards in Fanatic's play area?&nbsp;Has someone tested what the game's decision was on this one?&nbsp;</p>",
